---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
// Legacy source-test marker only; not rendered: 如果你知道实验室正在比较 OpenEvo、SEED 和 WebShop

const navItems = [
  { href: '#protocol', label: t('实验边界', 'Protocol') },
  { href: '#questions', label: t('七个问题', 'Seven questions') },
  { href: '#g2-ablation', label: t('第二代更新', 'G2 ablation') },
  { href: '#next-steps', label: t('下一步', 'Next steps') },
  { href: '#appendix', label: t('历史记录', 'History') },
] as const;
---

<header class="results-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">{t('研究结果 · RESEARCH FINDINGS', 'OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · RESEARCH FINDINGS')}</p>
  <h1>{t('OpenEvo × WebShop 研究结果', 'OpenEvo × WebShop research findings')}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{t(
    '我们在同一套 WebShop 任务上比较基础 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 与加载 OpenEvo SD-LoRA 后的模型，追踪三件事：模型是否真的学到可迁移经验、纠错后的 128×2 评测是否支持稳定优势、下一轮公平比较还缺什么。',
    'We compare base Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct with the same model plus OpenEvo SD-LoRA on matched WebShop tasks, tracking three questions: whether the model learns transferable experience, whether the corrected 128×2 evaluation supports a stable advantage, and what remains before the next fair comparison.',
  )}</p>

  <div class="abstract-box" aria-label={t('30 秒进度摘要', '30-second progress summary')}>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label established">{t('已经知道', 'What we know')}</span>
      <div class="abstract-copy">
        <p class="plain">{t(
          '模型从自己做成功的任务里学习一次以后，面对训练时没见过的新任务，表现确实可以变好；而且这个现象后来又复现了一次。',
          'After one update from its own successful trajectories, the model can perform better on tasks it did not see during training, and that effect was reproduced independently.',
        )}</p>
        <p class="technical"><strong>{t('专业解释：', 'Technical detail: ')}</strong>{t(
          'H1.38B 与 H1.39 支持一次参数更新后的内部新任务迁移（internal fresh task-ID-disjoint transfer）。这仍然不是 SEED 官方最终保留题上的论文复现，也不能证明多代连续改进。',
          'H1.38B and H1.39 support one-step internal fresh task-ID-disjoint transfer after a parameter update. This is still not a paper reproduction on SEED’s final held-out denominator, and it does not establish stable multi-generation improvement.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label latest">{t('最新评测', 'Latest evaluation')}</span>
      <div class="abstract-copy">
        <p class="plain">{t(
          '现在已经有一轮真正按纠错后的 SEED 公开代码任务语义完成的 128×2 配对评测。OpenEvo 的平均完成度高一点，但完整成功率和基础模型一样，而且统计区间仍然跨过“没有差异”，所以仍然不能说它稳定更好。',
          'We now have a completed 128×2 paired evaluation on the corrected task semantics recoverable from released SEED code. OpenEvo has a somewhat higher average task score, but exact success is tied with the base model and the uncertainty interval still crosses no difference, so a stable advantage is not established.',
        )}</p>
        <p class="technical"><strong>{t('专业解释：', 'Technical detail: ')}</strong>{t(
          'source-faithful Track A 先通过 authoritative runtime semantic validation 128/128，随后 BASE 与冻结 SD-LoRA 都完成 128/128 个有效回合，parser-invalid=0。SD-LoRA 的平均 Task Score 方向更高，但配对不确定性区间跨过 0；256 个 raw episode 与分析/receipt 已 byte-for-byte 入库并 PUBLISHED_AND_VERIFIED。精确统计量放在下方 Q7 的实验依据里。',
          'Source-faithful Track A first passed authoritative runtime semantic validation at 128/128. BASE and the frozen SD-LoRA then each completed 128/128 valid episodes with parser-invalid=0. Mean Task Score is directionally higher for SD-LoRA, but the paired uncertainty interval crosses zero; all 256 raw episodes plus analysis and receipts are published and byte-for-byte verified. Exact statistics are kept in Q7’s experiment evidence below.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label bottleneck">{t('接下来', 'What remains')}</span>
      <div class="abstract-copy">
        <p class="plain">{t(
          '最关键的剩余问题已经从“Gen28 的状态能不能补回来”推进到“是否正式恢复 Track B / WB1 并进入 Gen29”。Gen28 的 128 个 episode 已完成，对应的 state-v28 也已经通过封存输入上的 deferred native update 与 barrier reconciliation 被采用；但这不自动授权下一代训练，所以现在仍不能直接续跑。',
          'The key remaining question has moved from repairing Gen28 continuity to deciding whether Track B / WB1 should formally resume into Gen29. Gen28’s 128 episodes are complete and state-v28 has now been adopted after the sealed-input deferred native update and barrier reconciliation; that adoption does not automatically authorize another generation, so task-bearing continuation remains blocked.',
        )}</p>
        <p class="technical"><strong>{t('专业解释：', 'Technical detail: ')}</strong>{t(
          'Track A 已以 measurement-not-proven-stable-improvement 关闭，且不能冒充论文 89.7 / 78.1% 的 exact reproduction。当前 WB1 classification 是 GEN28_STATE_V28_BARRIER_PASS_ADOPTED；latest native state 是 state-v28，matched experience budget 已记到 3,584/20,640，剩余 17,056。formal_task_consumption_allowed=false、gpu_allocation_allowed=false、final_test_status=locked；下一步是单独的 Gen29 execution-readiness / resumption decision。',
          'Track A is closed as measurement-not-proven-stable-improvement and must not be presented as an exact reproduction of the paper’s 89.7 / 78.1%. Current WB1 classification is GEN28_STATE_V28_BARRIER_PASS_ADOPTED; the latest native state is state-v28, matched experience accounting is 3,584/20,640 with 17,056 remaining, and formal_task_consumption_allowed=false, gpu_allocation_allowed=false, final_test_status=locked. The next gate is a separate Gen29 execution-readiness / resumption decision.',
        )}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cutoff-note">
    <strong>{t('证据时间边界', 'Evidence cutoff')}</strong>
    <span>{t(
      '机制结论截至 H1.41。H1.42 是之后的测量校准记录；2026-08-25 的 repaired PRIMARY-v2、2026-08-26 的源码忠实任务纠错与随后完成的 Track A 128×2 配对测量，都属于另外的证据层，不会被倒过来混进 H1.41 的机制结论。',
      'Mechanism conclusions are cut off at H1.41. H1.42 is a later measurement-calibration record; the repaired PRIMARY-v2 on 2026-08-25, the source-faithful task correction on 2026-08-26, and the later completed Track A 128×2 paired measurement are separate evidence layers and are not blended backward into the H1.41 mechanism conclusions.',
    )}</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('研究结果导航', 'Research results navigation')}>
    {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
  </nav>
</header>

<style>
  .results-hero{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 12px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.12em}
  .results-hero h1{margin:0;max-width:940px;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5vw,4.35rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.05em}
  .lede{max-width:800px;margin:22px 0 0;color:var(--color-text);font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.75}
  .abstract-box{max-width:960px;margin-top:30px;border-block:2px solid var(--color-text)}
  .abstract-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:18px 0}
  .abstract-row+.abstract-row{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .abstract-label{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.7}
  .abstract-label.established{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .abstract-label.latest{color:var(--color-info)}
  .abstract-label.bottleneck{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .abstract-copy{display:grid;gap:8px}
  .abstract-copy p{margin:0;max-width:76ch;line-height:1.72}
  .abstract-copy .plain{font-size:.94rem;color:var(--color-text)}
  .abstract-copy .technical{padding-top:7px;border-top:1px dashed var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.8rem}
  .abstract-copy .technical strong{color:var(--color-text);font-weight:760}
  .cutoff-note{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:960px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.8rem}
  .cutoff-note strong{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .cutoff-note span{max-width:80ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1.3rem;max-width:960px;margin-top:22px;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .paper-nav a{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:720;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:.2em}
  .paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .results-hero{padding:24px 18px 8px}
    .abstract-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}
  }
</style>